      "created_at": "2012-11-16T19:09:22.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>As I figure a fair number of the people here are comic book fans, I was curious as to how many of you have played the soon to be shutdown, City of Heroes?</p>\n<p>I’ve been playing it since launch, and will miss it come December.  Most of my friends there call me “GTG,” for one of my more infamous/entertaining characters, Guilt Trip Girl.  I used to team quite a bit with a Freight Train back in the day, and his Brute alter-ego “Fright Train,” so seeing the picture for the Vengeance art brought up fond memories from the early years.</p>",
