      "created_at": "2012-11-16T19:45:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I played it briefly... wow... YEARS ago. I would say around when they added villains.</p><p>That is when I created my main \"hero\" that I put in every game (Champions Online, DCU ONLINE) called The Vocalist... a hard rocking, vocal blasting hero who is not exactly sure how he got his powers... given how much hard partying he did in the 80's.</p>",
