      "id": 44871,
      "name": "TheSoundOfTrees",
      "username": "TheSoundOfTrees",
      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/t/da6949/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-16T19:52:21.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I didn't know the game was shut down. It makes me really sad. I played for years, only drifting away when my taste for computer games began to fade. It is still the MMORPG I remember the most fondly, and in fact I was planning to try to convince the members of my wife's WoW guild to try it.</p><p>As a former computer game designer, I consider it as one of the most intelligently designed MMORPGs : the possibility to have characters of different levels playing together, the ability to \"travel back in time\" and play at a lower level, and so on, were an incredibly interesting and apropriate design.</p><p>Adieu, Gravity Girl.</p><p>&nbsp;</p>",
      "post_number": 3,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:18:26.574Z",
