      "id": 44878,
      "name": "Ameena",
      "username": "Ameena",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ameena/{size}/1907_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-11-17T12:25:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I can remember CoH coming out - several people left EQ for a while in order to play it.I wasn't one of them, though. It sounded like an okay game at the time but as I was into EQ, it didn't really interest me. After I fizzled out of EQ I haven't played an MMORPG since (except for a few weeks of Runescape a couple of years ago, if that counts). I'm now waiting for EQC to finish development so I can play EQ like it used to be in the good old days before it become watered down and massively unbalanced with about five million expansions :P.</p>",
